      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "**轮也是不能省功的.**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "大量的实践表明，**使用任何机械都不能省功.** 使用各种",
        "不同的机械只是为了根据不同的工作条件而达到省力或省路",
        "程的目的."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "古代的学者们就已经知道了对所有机械都适用的著名规",
        "律：**省多少倍的力就要费多少倍的距离.** 这条规律被称为是",
        "**力学的“黄金定律”.**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "exhead",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "问题"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "（1）作用在杠杆上的力与力臂之间存在着什么关系（参",
        "看图181）？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "2",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "（2）作用在杠杆上的力的作用点所通过的路程与力的大",
        "小之间存在着什么关系？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "3",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "（3）使用杠杆能不能省力？若能省力需多费什么？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "4",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "（4）当使用动滑轮提升重物时，要费多少倍的路程？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "5",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "（5）力学的“黄金定律”的内容是什么？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "exhead",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "练习 38"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "**（1）用动滑轮将重物提升了1.5米，问在这个过程中绳的自由端拉**",
        "**伸了多长？**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "2",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "**（2）用动滑轮将重物提升了7米. 如果工人加在绳端的拉力是**",
        "**160牛顿，问他在提升重物时做了多少功？若只把重物提升了5米，他**",
        "**做的功又是多少？**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "3",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "**（3）怎样使用动滑轮来达到节省距离的目的？**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "exhead",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
